  m_Name: clues-wedding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PartyGame.Runtime::PartyGame.Core.Content.CluePackData
  id: clues-wedding
  displayName: The wedding
  description: A big day with a small disaster
  glyph: WD
  accentIndex: 6
  enabled: 1
  premium: 0
  freshness: 0
  reviewBy: 
  clues:
  - id: c52
    kind: 0
    text: The top tier of the cake is missing and the photographer has gone very quiet.
  - id: c53
    kind: 0
    text: Somebody rewrote the seating plan an hour before the guests arrived.
  - id: c54
    kind: 0
    text: The best man's speech notes were found in the car park.
  - id: c55
    kind: 0
    text: Three people have claimed the same plus one.
  - id: c56
    kind: 0
    text: The first dance playlist was swapped for something nobody chose.
  - id: c57
    kind: 0
    text: A gift envelope was opened and sealed again badly.
  - id: c58
    kind: 0
    text: Somebody has been quietly drinking the top table champagne all afternoon.
  - id: c59
    kind: 0
    text: The confetti was thrown twenty minutes before the couple came out.
  - id: c60
    kind: 1
    text: You were at the door greeting guests. Exactly one of {a} and {b} slipped away.
  - id: c61
    kind: 1
    text: 'The seating plan narrows it: one of {a} and {b} was not where they should be.'
  - id: c62
    kind: 1
    text: Two people left during the speeches. Exactly one of {a} and {b} is involved.
  - id: c63
    kind: 2
    text: You had the best view in the room from the top table. {fact}
  - id: c64
    kind: 2
    text: You noticed which way the room turned. {fact}
  - id: c65
    kind: 2
    text: You were watching faces during the speeches. {fact}
  - id: c66
    kind: 3
    text: It turned up in the wedding photos. {fact}
  - id: c67
    kind: 3
    text: A guest mentioned it to the venue staff. {fact}
  - id: c68
    kind: 3
    text: The DJ announced it by mistake over the microphone. {fact}
